<title>JAPAN: MOF likely to offer 2-yr notes on Thursday - traders.</title>
<headline>MOF likely to offer 2-yr notes on Thursday - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) is likely to offer two-year government notes through a price-competitive auction next Thursday, bond traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The amount of the offer is likely to be around 120 billion yen, bond traders said.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Treasury Desk, +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
